{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月13日，微軟表示，持續近兩天的大規模服務故障正在逐步得到修復，Outlook郵箱及其他Microsoft 365服務的可用性和郵件投遞表現已有改善，但部分用户仍可能遇到間歇性連接問題。此次故障始於周四下午，波及全球多地企業、政府機構及其他組織。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586314.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:45:31.610029+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:29:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_hash":"191db561f5d34590553068c4e4c55e5fff383d01dbd4bf78371448fc76ae991e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}